        {
          "id": "S3-1",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "norma",
          "text": "车辙一直延伸到洞口。跟紧了。",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-2",
      "cursor": 1,
      "sectionId": "S3-2",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S3-2",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "norma",
          "text": "洞口有哨兵。弩手在后面。",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-3",
      "cursor": 2,
      "sectionId": "S3-3",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S3-3",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "elora",
          "text": "这里暂时安全。……先检查一下伤口吧。",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-4",
      "cursor": 3,
      "sectionId": "S3-4",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S3-4",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "norma",
          "text": "草药箱、书箱和包袱都在货台上。匪首也在。",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-4.choice",
      "cursor": 4,
      "sectionId": "S3-4",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "准备接近货台。",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "label": "守住出口"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "label": "堵住退路"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "label": "先检查货物"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-5",
      "cursor": 5,
      "sectionId": "S3-5",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S3-5",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "eustice",
          "text": "货物齐了。沿原路撤回。",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S4-1",
      "cursor": 6,
      "sectionId": "S4-1",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S4-1",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "elora",
          "text": "草药找回来了……谢谢。",
          "emotion": "smile"
        },
        {
          "id": "S4-1.page.1",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "kororo",
          "text": "……书没湿。",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": "S4-1.page.2",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "marietta",
          "text": "包袱收到了。我会把旧毯子修好。",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S4-2",
      "cursor": 7,
      "sectionId": "S4-2",
      "kind": "beat",
      "frames": [
        {
          "id": "S4-2",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "marietta",
          "text": "诸位先歇一歇。旧庄园的事，稍后还要劳烦各位。",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        },
        {
          "id": "S4-2.page.1",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "actorId": "norma",
          "text": "缺什么就去缇比那儿补齐。",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
